From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Flysoft <flysoftbeta@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:43:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 15/27] Add native GMB capture and keyed D3D11 texture export
 for PRTS

Keep the bounded CPU pool and passive refresh recovery; isolate Viz key-0 mutex ownership from wire key-0/1 textures and recover rejected imports per target.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

